# No preview or browser verification

Do not start Shopify theme preview (`shopify theme dev`), local servers, Cursor browser tabs, screenshots, or any other live-page preview to check work.

Do not use browser tools for this project unless the user explicitly asks to open a page.

After code changes, stop. Do not verify layout or behavior in a browser.
